          "title": "The sum of their squares",
          "body": "The sum of their squares is\n\\[\n(2n+1)^2+(2n+3)^2\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=4n^2+4n+1+4n^2+12n+9\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=8n^2+16n+10\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=8(n^2+2n+1)+2=8(n+1)^2+2\n\\]"
